{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is visible, approach it, grab it, move to destination and perform task. Otherwise, scan the area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectCheckable    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    />",
